From 1a2b3c4d5e6f7089abcdef0123456789abcdef01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Koen Kooi <koen.kooi@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 15:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] image-oci: use rsync --checksum --no-times for
 cross-image layer dedup

An app image sharing OCI_BASE_IMAGE with a base image should not
duplicate content the base already provides. It does:

- oci_multilayer_install_packages() merges the layer rootfs into the
  base bundle with plain "rsync -a", which decides whether to re-copy
  a file by size+mtime, not content.
- Per-recipe SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH means the same package built for two
  different image recipes is byte-identical but has a different
  mtime, so rsync always re-copies it.
- rsync -a also implies --times, so the re-copy overwrites the
  matching mtime the base already had, confirmed via
  --itemize-changes: ">f..t...... usr/lib/libc.so.6".
- umoci repack then sees a changed file and duplicates its content
  into the new layer, defeating dedup entirely.

Add --checksum (compare content, not size+mtime) and --no-times
(leave an unchanged file's mtime alone). Reproduced with a base image
and an app image both installing coreutils via a "packages:" layer:
unpatched, blobs total 14.4 MiB; patched, 7.26 MiB, with the app's
files now byte- and mtime-identical to the base's.

Signed-off-by: Koen Kooi <koen.kooi@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 classes/image-oci-umoci.inc | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/classes/image-oci-umoci.inc b/classes/image-oci-umoci.inc
index a033d73a..7c5f1e02 100644
--- a/classes/image-oci-umoci.inc
+++ b/classes/image-oci-umoci.inc
@@ -582,8 +582,12 @@ IMAGE_CMD:oci() {

                 if [ -d "$oci_preinstall_rootfs" ]; then
                     bbnote "OCI: Copying pre-installed packages from $oci_preinstall_rootfs"
-                    # Use rsync to merge into bundle rootfs (handles symlinks properly)
-                    rsync -a --no-owner --no-group "$oci_preinstall_rootfs/" "$image_bundle_name/rootfs/"
+                    # --checksum --no-times: compare by content, not size+mtime, and
+                    # don't touch mtime on a match. Needed so a file already provided
+                    # by OCI_BASE_IMAGE stays identical across images instead of being
+                    # re-copied with a fresh per-recipe mtime, which would otherwise
+                    # make umoci repack duplicate it into this layer.
+                    rsync -a --checksum --no-times --no-owner --no-group "$oci_preinstall_rootfs/" "$image_bundle_name/rootfs/"

                     # Create usrmerge symlinks in the first packages layer.
                     # Normally done by ROOTFS_PREPROCESS_COMMAND in do_rootfs,
